   "rating": 6,
   "date": "2007-03-07T20:04:32-06:00",
   "body": "Once I was killing the \"buzzards\" and not the \"starving buzzards\", this really wasnt a problem. The final one was the worst, but all in all, I would say I killed about 12 for the 4 wings. The best place to find them, is around Agmond's End. (I dont use a cords site.) There is alot of coyotes and cheetah style enimies there though, so watch your back. Also, there is a silver buzzard spawn that killed me twice. I have no clue what level it is, shows up as a skull for me. I am 43 Night Elf Druid, Nervarah from Durotan.",
   "replies": []
  },
  {
   "rating": 5,
   "date": "2006-03-07T20:04:32-06:00",
