   "rating": 5,
   "date": "2005-05-30T22:59:19-05:00",
   "body": "WOW 50% of the kills ?\nI killed maybe 20 buzzards without any drop !\nThen I found a great place for this quest : just east of the very western cemetary.\nThere you will find about 10 giant buzzards in a circle !\nKill them one by one and circle around. By the time you are finished your early kills will soon repop so that you ahave an infinite amount of buzzards there.\nIn no time and about 20 additional kills I had the 4 wings !\n\nEdited, Mon May 30 19:02:58 2005",
   "replies": []
